32X Game Gear Player License

Copyright (c) 2026 the 32X Game Gear Player authors and contributors.

This repository contains a mix of:

- original 32X-specific code written for this project;
- code ported or adapted from MEKA by Omar Cornut and contributors; and
- code/data derived from Marat Fayzullin's Z80 core as carried into MEKA.

To keep the whole source tree available under one compatible set of terms,
the source code in this repository is made available under the following
license terms.

