Provenance notes

Based on the current audit of this repository, the following active files are
known to contain code or data ported/adapted from MEKA and/or Marat
Fayzullin's Z80 core:

- 32x/include/sh2/gg_emu.h
- 32x/include/sh2/gg_vdp.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_opcodes.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_ops.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_ops_cb.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_ops_ed.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_ops_xcb.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_ops_xx.h
- 32x/include/sh2/z80_tables.h
- 32x/src/sh2/gg_io.c
- 32x/src/sh2/gg_mem.c
- 32x/src/sh2/gg_render.c
- 32x/src/sh2/gg_vdp.c
- 32x/src/sh2/z80.c

Most of the remaining 32X-specific runtime, rendering pipeline, audio relay,
assembly interpreter work, and performance optimizations are original to this
project, but they are distributed under the same terms above for simplicity
and compatibility.

Relation to upstream MEKA terms

This license is intended to preserve the substance of the source terms
documented by upstream MEKA in meka/sources.txt, namely:

- no warranty;
- reuse for any purpose; and
- preservation of license terms plus source availability for modifications.

This repository does not bundle the full MEKA project. It contains only this
project's source tree plus ported/adapted portions noted above.

